  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you import lectures
  s1 --> s2: indexing finishes
  s2 --> s3: you ask
  s3 --> s4: no chunk covers the question
  s3 --> s5: chunks cover the question
  s4 --> s6: the model starts thinking
  s5 --> s6: the model starts thinking
  s6 --> s7: you stop
  s6 --> s8: answer text starts
  s7 --> s3: you ask
  s8 --> s7: you stop
  s8 --> s9: the reply finishes [nothing was retrieved]
  s8 --> s10: the reply finishes [a chunk was retrieved]
  s9 --> s3: you ask
  s10 --> s3: you ask
